# Copy to .env for local dev.
#
# IMPORTANT: these are read at BUILD time, not at runtime. Every public page is
# prerendered, so the value is baked into the HTML by `astro build`. Set it
# wherever the build runs:
#   - `npm run deploy` builds on your machine → this .env is enough
#   - building in CI or Cloudflare's build system → add it as a build-time
#     environment variable there
# `wrangler secret put` does NOT work for this: a runtime Worker secret is never
# seen by already-prerendered HTML, and the form would ship dead.

# Web3Forms access key — one free account per client, leads go to their inbox.
# Get it at https://web3forms.com (enter the CLIENT's email, copy the key).
# This key is not a credential: it ships as a hidden input in the page HTML and
# is visible in view-source by design.
WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=

# Keystatic Cloud runs auth for the /keystatic admin in production. No key is
# needed here; set the project in src/config/site.ts + keystatic.config.ts.
# For local editing without Keystatic Cloud, see SETUP.md (local storage mode).
